# システム環境設定's 表示の倍率 while the desktop runs (design 10.2.3), for tools/ui_run.py and
# tools/x64/ui_run64.py (a screen of 1280x800: 100%, 125% and 150% leave a view of 640x480 or more).
# The window is at 160,80: the device list's first line 画面サイズ／色数 at 206,181 and 表示 at
# 706,184; on the screen's page the pop-up 表示の倍率 at 658,455 (its list opens with the row of
# the scale chosen over it, a row 20 high: 150% two rows down) and 設定 at 706,554. The desktop's
# question (確認, 30 seconds) is answered with Esc to put the scale before back and Enter to keep it.
# The window, moved up to fit the view at 150%, comes back to where it was opened, 160,80, when
# 100% is put back (design 10.2.2).
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen scale 100%, 3 scales
wait 500
shot sc_page
click 658 455
wait 300
shot sc_list
click 658 495
wait 300
click 706 554
expect drawn at 100% -> 150%, asked
expect wm: drawn at 150% (was 100%), a view of 854 x 534
wait 1500
shot sc_ask
key 29
expect drawn at 100% again
expect sysenv: screen scale 100%, 3 scales
wait 800
shot sc_back
# moved up inside the view of 854x534 at 150%, the window is back at 160,80 at 100%
win システム環境設定
want ok 160 80 780 584
click 658 455
wait 300
click 658 495
wait 300
click 706 554
expect wm: drawn at 150% (was 100%), a view of 854 x 534
wait 1500
key 28
expect drawn at 150%, kept
expect sysenv: screen scale 150%, 3 scales
wait 1000
shot sc_150
win システム環境設定
absent !OACV!
